  "description": "Autonomous UAV navigation system featuring real-time 2.5D occupancy-grid mapping, A* global path planning, and depth + LiDAR sensor fusion for dynamic obstacle avoidance in complex urban environments. Fully integrated with ROS 2, PX4 Offboard control, and Gazebo simulation for high-fidelity testing and deployment.",
